# A cloud not to be trusted signs a device in as alice on its own (it can mint her a credential) and says something in
# the test chat with it: the station, going by the lock and not the cloud, refuses it; nothing of it comes to the chat.
#only android
timeout 120000
until 端到端测试
log do: intruder-refused send 冒名消息 {T}
done 1-intruder-refused
tap 端到端测试
until 端到端测试的对话
gone 冒名消息
shot 1-chat
